{"id":"nbf9f7f3693","headline":"In August, the hunger line exceeded 37 thousand lira","summary":"According to a Türk-İş survey, the monthly food cost of healthy, balanced nutrition for a family of four rose to 37,388 lira in August. This is the hunger line.","why":"The Türk-İş hunger line is a widely cited indicator of food inflation pressure on households in Turkey, influencing wage negotiations and consumer demand.","category":"economy","event_type":"macro-data","importance":1,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Istanbul","country":"Turkey","lat":41.01,"lon":28.98,"region":"eu"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"Bloomberght","url":"https://www.bloomberght.com/agustos-ta-aclik-sinir-37-bin-lirayi-asti-3786849"},"sources":[{"name":"Bloomberght","url":"https://www.bloomberght.com/agustos-ta-aclik-sinir-37-bin-lirayi-asti-3786849"}],"published_at":"2026-08-31T07:18:16Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-12T10:44:44Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"2092ad264190e5db","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-12T10:44:44Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-08-31T07:18:16Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-08-31T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"TU","description_from":"publisher page metadata, translated to English by Claude"},"headline_translated":true,"original_headline":"Ağustos'ta açlık sınırı 37 bin lirayı aştı","source_language":"tur","image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/shopping-retail-store-2615482.jpg","alt":"shopping retail store (illustration)","credit":"Alexas_Fotos","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/shopping-corona-business-vegetables-2615482/"}}